			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>bind fast, retain</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. δίς</span>
			<i>repeat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				7.8
			</span></i>.</div>
